  "pli-tv-pvr9:2.7": "",
  "pli-tv-pvr9:2.8": "",
  "pli-tv-pvr9:2.9": "saddhammaṭṭhitiyā taṃ vinayānuggahāya. ",
  "pli-tv-pvr9:3.1": "yaṃ saṃghasuṭṭhu taṃ saṃghaphāsu. ",
  "pli-tv-pvr9:3.2": "yaṃ saṃghasuṭṭhu taṃ dummaṅkūnaṃ puggalānaṃ niggahāya . . . ",
