  "pli-tv-pvr9:9.1": "paṭhamaṃ aṭṭha pucchāya, ",
  "pli-tv-pvr9:9.2": "paccayesu pun' aṭṭha ca: ",
  "pli-tv-pvr9:9.3": "bhikkhūnaṃ soḷasā ete ",
  "pli-tv-pvr9:9.4": "bhikkhunīnañ ca soḷasa. | ",
  "pli-tv-pvr9:10.1": "peyyāla-antarabhedā, ",
  "pli-tv-pvr9:10.2": "ekuttarikam eva ca, ",
  "pli-tv-pvr9:10.3": "pavāraṇ' -atthavasikā: ",
